Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:28:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 16/16] nexus_engine 0.6: game drawn inside the NEXUS window,
 shortcut keys freed from the default keyboard layout, amiibo

- embed: the game window becomes a child of the NEXUS window when it is revealed and follows
  its size; F11 is reported to NEXUS (fullscreenPresses), which makes its window full screen.
- NEXUS shortcuts (Home H, F11, F12, Alt+F12) take priority over the default keyboard layout:
  a default binding on one of those keys moves to a free key (keyboardMoves in the status).
- nexus_engine_amiibo(path): places or removes an amiibo dump on the virtual NFC reader;
  status amiibo: none | scanning | placed.
